---
---
<section class="hero-band">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="display-xl">현존과 에고 사이,<br />진실된 자기 탐구</h1>
      <p class="body-md text-muted">존재의 본질을 이해하고 에고의 굴레에서 벗어나는 여정을 기록합니다.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/posts" class="btn btn-primary">글 읽기</a>
        <a href="/about" class="btn btn-secondary">소개</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-illustration">
      <div class="hero-illustration-card">
        <img src="/images/hero-illustration.jpg" alt="현존과 에고 일러스트" loading="eager" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-band {
    padding: var(--spacing-section) 0;
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
  }
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
    gap: var(--spacing-xxl);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .hero-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  .display-xl {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    white-space: pre-line;
  }
  .body-md {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .text-muted {
    color: #4b5563; /* Can be replaced if there is a muted color token */
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-md);
    margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--spacing-sm) var(--spacing-xl);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-pill);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-canvas);
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
  }
  .btn-secondary {
    background-color: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }
  .btn-secondary:hover {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-soft);
  }
  .hero-illustration-card {
    background-color: var(--color-surface-soft);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-xl);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .hero-illustration-card img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>
